---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: /contact/index.html
title: Get a Quote
description: >-
  Request a commercial or industrial painting quote from SS Deol. Written quotes
  within 48 hours, after-hours and shutdown work across Victoria. Or call us
  directly.
---

<section class="page-hero">
  {% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="eyebrow">Get a quote</p>
    <h1>Tell us about the job</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      The more you can tell us, the more accurate the quote. Photos of the
      surfaces are genuinely useful — a phone snap of the problem area saves a
      site visit and gets you a firmer price. We answer every enquiry within
      48 hours.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap split split--start">

    {# ============================================================ THE FORM == #}
    <div>
      <div class="notice" style="margin-bottom:2rem">
        <p><strong>Prefer to talk?</strong> Call
          <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}">{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</a>
          {{ site.hours.emergency | lower }}. If the form below is not working,
          call or email — we lose far fewer enquiries than websites suggest.</p>
      </div>

      <h2 style="font-size:var(--step-3)">Quote request</h2>

      <form class="form"
            action="https://api.web3forms.com/submit"
            method="POST"
            novalidate
            data-quote-form
            data-phone="{{ site.phone | tel }}"
            data-email="{{ site.email }}">

        {# Required by Web3Forms. This key is designed to be visible in page
           source — it is an alias to your inbox, not a password. #}
        <input type="hidden" name="access_key" value="{{ site.accessKey }}">
        <input type="hidden" name="subject" value="New quote request from ssdeol.com.au">
        <input type="hidden" name="from_name" value="SS Deol Website">

        {# --- spam trap: hidden from people, filled in by naive bots --- #}
        <div class="hp" aria-hidden="true">
          <label for="company_website">Leave this field empty</label>
          <input type="text" id="company_website" name="botcheck" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-name">Your name <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="f-name" name="name" autocomplete="name" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-company">Company</label>
            <input type="text" id="f-company" name="company" autocomplete="organization">
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-phone">Phone <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="tel" id="f-phone" name="phone" autocomplete="tel" required>
            <p class="hint">Mobile preferred — we often ask before we arrive.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-email">Email <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="email" id="f-email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required>
            <p class="hint">This is where the written quote goes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-suburb">Suburb / site address <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
            <input type="text" id="f-suburb" name="suburb" required>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-property">Type of property</label>
            <select id="f-property" name="property_type">
              <option value="">Please choose…</option>
              <option>Warehouse / distribution centre</option>
              <option>Factory / manufacturing</option>
              <option>Office / commercial</option>
              <option>Retail / shopfront</option>
              <option>Strata / body corporate</option>
              <option>School / childcare</option>
              <option>Aged care</option>
              <option>Hospitality</option>
              <option>Transport depot</option>
              <option>Utility / energy site</option>
              <option>Other</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-service">Service needed</label>
            <select id="f-service" name="service">
              <option value="">Not sure yet</option>
              {%- for s in services.services -%}
              <option>{{ s.title }}</option>
              {%- endfor -%}
              <option>Something else / not listed</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-size">Approximate size</label>
            <select id="f-size" name="size">
              <option value="">Not sure</option>
              <option>Under 250 m²</option>
              <option>250 – 1,000 m²</option>
              <option>1,000 – 5,000 m²</option>
              <option>5,000 – 15,000 m²</option>
              <option>Over 15,000 m²</option>
              <option>Several buildings / multiple sites</option>
            </select>
            <p class="hint">A rough guess is fine. If you are not sure, leave it.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form__row">
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-timing">When do you need it done?</label>
            <select id="f-timing" name="timing">
              <option value="">Flexible</option>
              <option>Urgent — needs a crew ASAP</option>
              <option>Within a month</option>
              <option>1 – 3 months</option>
              <option>Next financial year</option>
              <option>Planning / budgeting only</option>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="field">
            <label for="f-hours">When can we work?</label>
            <select id="f-hours" name="working_hours">
              <option value="">Happy to discuss</option>
              <option>Business hours only</option>
              <option>After hours / evenings</option>
              <option>Weekends</option>
              <option>Over our shutdown period</option>
              <option>Any of the above</option>
            </select>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label for="f-message">What needs doing? <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span></label>
          <textarea id="f-message" name="message" required
            placeholder="What the building is, what condition the surfaces are in, anything awkward about the access or the site, and anything we should know about the building's operation."></textarea>
        </div>
        <div class="field field--consent">
          <input type="checkbox" id="f-consent" name="consent" required>
          <label for="f-consent">
            I agree that SS Deol may use these details to prepare and send a
            quote. <span class="req" aria-hidden="true">*</span>
            <br><span class="hint">We do not sell or share your information.
            See our <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a>.</span>
          </label>
        </div>

        {# --- result messages are injected here by assets/js/main.js --- #}
        <div class="form__status" data-form-status role="alert" tabindex="-1"></div>
        <div>
          <button class="btn btn--green" type="submit" data-form-submit>
            Send my quote request
          </button>
          <p class="hint" style="margin-top:.8rem">
            We reply within 48 hours. Fields marked * are required.
          </p>
        </div>

        {# --- Anti-spam -----------------------------------------------------------
           Web3Forms provides hCaptcha free of charge on every plan. It works
           by THEIR script injecting the sitekey and rendering the widget — so
           loading js.hcaptcha.com directly fails with "Missing sitekey" and
           leaves the form unprotected. This file is required.

           Load it only when hCaptcha is actually switched on, so the free
           plan's included protection is preserved without paying for
           reCAPTCHA or Cloudflare Turnstile. ------------------------------- #}
        <div class="h-captcha" data-captcha="true"></div>
        <script src="https://web3forms.com/client/script.js" async defer></script>
      </form>
    </div>

    {# =========================================================== SIDE PANEL == #}
    <aside>
      <div class="plain-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <h3>What happens next</h3>
        <ol class="steps" style="margin-top:1rem">
          <li><h3>We read it</h3><p>Usually the same day.</p></li>
          <li><h3>We call you</h3><p>To clarify anything and book a site visit.</p></li>
          <li><h3>We inspect the site</h3><p>Surfaces, access, light, and the things a photo cannot show.</p></li>
          <li><h3>You get a written quote</h3><p>Within 48 hours. Itemised, no obligation.</p></li>
        </ol>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-card" style="margin-bottom:1.5rem">
        <h3>Talk to a person</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:.6rem">
          <a href="tel:{{ site.phone | tel }}"
             style="font-family:var(--font-head);font-size:var(--step-2);font-weight:700;text-decoration:none;color:var(--green)">
            {{ site.phoneDisplay }}
          </a>
        </p>
        {% if site.landline %}
        <p><a href="tel:{{ site.landline | tel }}">{{ site.landline }}</a></p>
        {%- endif -%}
        <p><a href="mailto:{{ site.email }}">{{ site.email }}</a></p>
        {%- if site.showHours -%}
        <p style="margin-top:.8rem;font-size:.92rem;color:var(--muted)">
          {{ site.hours.weekdays }}<br>
          {{ site.hours.weekends }}<br>
          {{ site.hours.emergency }}
        </p>
        {% endif %}
      </div>
      <div class="plain-card">
        <h3>Where we work</h3>
        <p style="margin-top:.6rem">
          All of Victoria, based out of Altona North in Melbourne's western
          industrial corridor.
        </p>
        <p><a href="/service-areas/">See the areas we cover</a></p>
      </div>
    </aside>

  </div>
</section>
{% include "partials/calculator.njk" %}

<section class="section section--pale">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <p class="eyebrow">Before you send</p>
      <h2>What makes our quote accurate</h2>
    </div>
    <div class="card-grid">
      <div class="plain-card">
        <h3>Photos of the problem area</h3>
        <p>A phone snap is fine. Wide and close, in good light.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-card">
        <h3>Which areas, in which order</h3>
        <p>Priority tells us where to start and what matters most.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-card">
        <h3>Your shutdown dates</h3>
        <p>The single biggest factor in a commercial price.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="plain-card">
        <h3>Access constraints</h3>
        <p>Loading docks, lift sizes, height limits, live plant.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>